"""
Run V7 per-egress service checks and update service-matrix.json.

The command is diagnostic only: it does not change routing, users, interfaces,
or sing-box configuration. Telegram is intentionally checked as a service made
of several TCP endpoints, because telegram.org HTTP availability does not prove
that MTProto/DC paths work through a given egress.
"""

